If you don't believe me, then check the shields yourself.

244
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:50,630
Sir, I can vouch for him.

245
00:18:50,710 --> 00:18:52,460
Steward, he's just had a bit too much to drink.

246
00:18:52,550 --> 00:18:55,720
Sir, something seems to have gone wrong. All the teleports have gone down.

247
